OL,3,GNEWSADoctor goes from triathlon novice
OL,4,Ato Team GB racer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doctor who had no formal sporting
OL,7,Fexperience is preparing to represent
OL,8,FGreat Britain in triathlon in a series
OL,9,Fof international events.
OL,11,FDr Gail Dovey-Pearce, 54, from
OL,12,FNorthumberland, is the head of clinical
OL,13,Fhealth psychology at Northumbria
OL,14,FHealthcare NHS Foundation Trust and
OL,15,Fonly began competing in triathlons
OL,16,Fabout a decade ago.
OL,18,FThe mother-of-two signed up for her
OL,19,Ffirst race just for fun and had to
OL,20,Fborrow a wet suit and bike to get to
OL,21,Fthe start line.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
