OL,3,GNEWSADoctor goes from triathlon novice
OL,4,Ato Team GB racer
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut in June Dovey-Pearce represented
OL,7,Fher country at the Age Group European
OL,8,FSprint Triathlon Championships in Spain
OL,9,Fand has been selected for the European
OL,10,Fand World Championships in 2027.
